{"id":"2914f307-7e45-492b-ab7a-01ebc3eb2781","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ad747382907403ad","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"aaee721bf4a0844081b761188903b525c0089ee2","start":8997,"end":9535},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","sinceCommit","=","async","(","path",":","string",")",":","Promise","<","{","\"","chain","\"",":","string","[]",";","\"","lastTime","\"",":","number","}",">","=>","{","const","AM","=","await","automerge","(",")",";","const","doc","=","await","docFor","(","path",")",";","const","head","=","await","engine",".","headContent","(","path",")",";","const","history","=","AM",".","getHistory","(","doc",")",";","let","base","=","0",";","for","(","let","index","=","0",";","index","<","history",".","length",";","index","+=","1",")","{","if","(","history","[","index","]",".","snapshot",".","text","===","head",")","{","base","=","index",";","}","}","return","{","\"","chain","\"",":","history",".","slice","(","base",")",".","map","(","(","entry",")","=>","entry",".","snapshot",".","text",")",",","\"","lastTime","\"",":","history",".","at","(","-","1",")","?.","change",".","time","??","0","}",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"a2386d358daceb63","after":"cc58771c56996ef7"}},"payload":{"text":"The file's history since the last commit: [HEAD, …each burst after it] (the last, the text as it is now) — from\nthe LAST snapshot equal to current HEAD, so it self-resets on commit — and when the latest burst was made.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:24.844Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:24.844Z"}
{"id":"5336599a-00d0-4c4b-8cf8-862eb83a3174","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"e24abce205cb42d8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3fbba39fda4fd93689218b5d4d5fe7b797455263","start":10751,"end":10807},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","{","groups",",","bursts","}","=","await","bablr",".","editGroups","(","chain",")"]},"context":{"before":"00eabc7e0d03894f","after":"193b53e5088a0de9"}},"payload":{"text":"The last entry is the current working text, so line ranges land in working coords.\n(decomposed by the BABLR worker: node-grouped chunks over the burst chain [HEAD, …afters])","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:20.160Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:20.160Z"}
{"id":"5c51cb46-9b1b-4fae-bfd9-2a94d1dbf355","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"944a7b54e03f5b49c01d05ea7c94d337b069b0ef","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"2c1cb6475bc215a0"}},"payload":{"text":"Edit-history — the FINE-GRAINED local tier of the two-tier history (Automerge = live edits, git = published commits).\nGit only ever sees the saved snapshot; this records the sequence of edit-bursts BETWEEN commits into a per-file\nAutomerge doc, so the changes pane can show \"the changes you introduced\" as small, attributable chunks instead of\none monolithic diff.\n\nCAPTURE (this module, workbench realm): coalesce keystrokes into idle-debounced BURSTS; each burst is one\n`Automerge.change` on a doc holding the file text. Lossless + append-only — grouping into meaningful units happens\nat DISPLAY time (by BABLR node), so the capture format never has to commit to a grouping. Persisted per file as the\n`Automerge.save` binary in silo's local/ (`.silo/local/edit-history/`, its own IndexedDB-backed mount — on this\nmachine, never committed), so it survives reload; the synced version is the Keyhive milestone. Automerge (WASM) is\nlazily imported so its weight never lands on cold start.\n\nBASELINE (\"since the last commit\"): the doc is seeded with the HEAD text as its first change, so the most recent\nhistory entry whose snapshot equals current HEAD marks the last commit — chunks are everything after it. This\nself-corrects on commit (the committed text becomes the latest snapshot, so the list empties) with nothing to store.\nAnd a file whose saved history ends at HEAD — nothing since the last commit — starts afresh: what came before it is\nnever shown, and silo's local/ is kept in memory, so it isn't kept.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:54.529Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:54.529Z"}
{"id":"6065cec2-e169-485d-ba48-0081582d2944","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3181759af5350399","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"130e7e98685bd62488cb3d8772852ddc4a90a82b","start":6068,"end":6117},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","flushing","=","new","Map","<","string",",","Promise","<","void",">",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"3d002c422a86b911","after":"f5ab1a307ab6a8ac"}},"payload":{"text":"A file's bursts are kept one after another: one flushed while the last still waits (on Automerge loading, the first\ntime) would start from the same doc, and the later would replace the earlier.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:36.256Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:36.256Z"}
{"id":"623871d3-7521-412f-b66f-84f01af0fcdd","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f74b5a6616128f8a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"265eea9accb051bc966f4957f69f5bbb1adae0c2","start":4933,"end":4989},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","loading","=","new","Map","<","string",",","Promise","<","AutomergeDoc",">",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"9ba19a0a4e5f340e","after":"2ebd4b0a6a0c9ebb"}},"payload":{"text":"(loaded once: two asking at once, before it's in `docs`, would each start one, and the later would replace the\nearlier, its bursts with it)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:40.900Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:40.900Z"}
{"id":"62e30f24-6d55-4d19-90d6-bd2cbb82b03f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"dc3ef3d4fd6e32ec","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"adde152de6419eeca19f7de5c7d7b14d488b4057","start":4057,"end":4101},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","docs","=","new","Map","<","string",",","AutomergeDoc",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"9e92e4af3727b748#0","after":"3d939353e2febe1e"}},"payload":{"text":"Per-file in-memory doc + its pending-flush timer. The doc is the source of truth; the binary on disk is a mirror.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:47.867Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:47.867Z"}
{"id":"6ae6bdae-92bf-4e64-b989-fdc4abcd0946","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"0207cf64c9fbf8d3","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"aea21a860d8534d29bc92aed96ea2133e2d53721","start":4647,"end":4777},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","doc","===","undefined","||","doc",".","text","===","head",")","{","doc","=","AM",".","change","(","AM",".","init","(",")",",","\"","seed","\"",",","(","draft",")","=>","{","draft",".","text","=","head",";","}",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"7de7a31fb4a45b28","after":"b3cf5d9f65ddcb4e"}},"payload":{"text":"Nothing since the last commit: what came before it is never shown, so the history starts afresh at HEAD.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:43.204Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:43.204Z"}
{"id":"6d090826-1735-43a8-aab0-e90bb9502fc0","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ad747382907403ad","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/edit-history.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9554c4469101956f9cf5acd7d8f17fafd7c1e6b9","start":8644,"end":9182},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","sinceCommit","=","async","(","path",":","string",")",":","Promise","<","{","\"","chain","\"",":","string","[]",";","\"","lastTime","\"",":","number","}",">","=>","{","const","AM","=","await","automerge","(",")",";","const","doc","=","await","docFor","(","path",")",";","const","head","=","await","engine",".","headContent","(","path",")",";","const","history","=","AM",".","getHistory","(","doc",")",";","let","base","=","0",";","for","(","let","index","=","0",";","index","<","history",".","length",";","index","+=","1",")","{","if","(","history","[","index","]",".","snapshot",".","text","===","head",")","{","base","=","index",";","}","}","return","{","\"","chain","\"",":","history",".","slice","(","base",")",".","map","(","(","entry",")","=>","entry",".","snapshot",".","text",")",",","\"","lastTime","\"",":","history",".","at","(","-","1",")","?.","change",".","time","??","0","}",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"a2386d358daceb63","after":"cc58771c56996ef7"}},"payload":{"text":"The \"your edits\" timeline: the reviewer's uncommitted work SINCE the last commit, decomposed into node-grouped\nchunks. Base = the LAST history snapshot equal to current HEAD (self-resets on commit); the burst chain from there\n[HEAD, …afters] is fed to the identity core (off-thread), which returns the net-changed nodes + their line ranges.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:27.103Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:18:27.103Z"}
